- Proof before any PASS: run `python <harness>/scripts/web-check.py <url> [<url> ...]` on every changed page of the production build or deployed URL and walk the core journey at phone and desktop viewport sizes, using a headless or proven background browser under `RULES.md "Screens, browsers and logins"` (a passing build, typecheck or test run is not a walkthrough). Cite `Web defaults: <web-check.json>` (overall PASS) and `Jobs review: <jobs-review.json>` next to `User journey evidence:`. Show the user the result in the chat with `python <harness>/scripts/delivery_card.py card` (before/after, animation, the page's link; `delivery-card.md`).

