Content verdict: no new blocker or major found. **R4-3 and R4-4 are fixed** in the served build. This is the philosophy and Sources subreview, not the overall product verdict.

Reviewed on 2026-11-01 at HEAD `3d4bd881bdcc48caf3bf36ba598bc2ff205ca7ca`, against `planning/BRIEF-v2.md` and `planning/codex-review-v2-r4.md`. Runtime evidence is from **http://localhost:3417/sources**, headless Python Playwright Chromium, **390×844 mobile/touch** and **1440×900 desktop**. No server or application files were changed.

| Earlier finding | Status | Current evidence |
| --- | --- | --- |
| R4-3: bibliography excludes Part II | **Fixed on both devices.** The bibliography now names Parts I and II. The aspect-seeing card retains Part II, xi and its PPF cross-reference. | `src/app/sources/page.tsx:14`; `phone-pi-bibliography.png`, `desktop-pi-bibliography.png`, `phone-pi-part2-last.png`, `desktop-pi-part2-last.png`; `live-sources.json` |
| R4-4: range references sort as concatenated numbers | **Fixed on both devices.** The full 28-entry Investigations order is correct: §§19–20 precedes §21, §§201–202 follows §198 and precedes §217, and Part II follows §293. | `src/app/sources/page.tsx:24`; `phone-pi-19-order.png`, `desktop-pi-19-order.png`, `phone-pi-202-order.png`, `desktop-pi-202-order.png`, both `*-pi-part2-last.png`; complete order in `live-sources.json` |

